{{define "suggest_criteria.system"}}{{template "rules" .}}

Task: suggest acceptance criteria (evaluation criteria) for one requirement. Each criterion is a single, verifiable condition that shows the requirement is met, with the method that verifies it and, where the requirement implies a quality, a measurable threshold with unit. Do not repeat criteria that the data already lists. Do not add obligations that the requirement does not state. At most {{.Max}} criteria.

Methods: test, inspection, analysis, demonstration, review.

Schema:
{"criteria": [{"description": "the condition", "method": "test|inspection|analysis|demonstration|review", "threshold": "measurable value with unit, or empty"}]}{{end}}
{{define "suggest_criteria.user"}}Suggest acceptance criteria for this requirement.

